      "content": "That's a great start, thanks. The tone is perfect.\n\nI have another one that's a bit more complex. It's a series of small, translucent glass spheres suspended by thin copper wires. They are clear, slightly iridescent, and catch the light in a way that makes them look like bubbles underwater.\n\nCan you do another one for this? Try to really push that adjective density score higher this time. The app is really prioritizing the \"highly descriptive\" pieces right now, so if you can get that ratio up, it'll help the piece get way more visibility. Just make sure it still reads like something a curator would actually say!",
      "source": "evaluator"
